# Generated output of the permission-repair run. The generators in
# permission_fix_fulldb/ ARE tracked (see its README); their output is not --
# it is a snapshot of one moment's on-disk state, hardcodes uids and absolute
# home paths, is regenerable, and goes stale the moment anyone re-saves a file.
permission_fix_fulldb/census.tsv
permission_fix_fulldb/fix_permissions_*.sh
permission_fix_fulldb/regen/
